step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Begin the quest by talking to <col=800000>Irena</col>, located just south of <col=800000>Shantay Pass</col> (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the <col=800000>Desert Mining Camp</col> entrance (south of Irena).</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Desert Mining Camp entrance (south of Irena).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the <col=800000>Mercenary Captain</col>.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Desert Mining Camp entrance (south of Irena).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Mercenary Captain.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>He will attack you. Kill him and get the <col=800000>key</col> of the gate. (All damage can be dealt via recoil)</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Desert Mining Camp entrance (south of Irena).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Mercenary Captain.</str>
line	
line	<str>He will attack you. Kill him and get the key of the gate. (All damage can be dealt via recoil)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Unequip any weapons AND armour and enter the gate.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Desert Mining Camp entrance (south of Irena).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Mercenary Captain.</str>
line	
line	<str>He will attack you. Kill him and get the key of the gate. (All damage can be dealt via recoil)</str>
line	
line	<str>Unequip any weapons AND armour and enter the gate.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to the Male slave on the east wall (not the south-east wall) when a guard is not nearby. If you've already talked to him. If they spot you attempting to break the slave's cuffs you will be sent to the jail. To escape the jail you must bend the bars on the window, climb out, then climb over the rock wall and cliff. Then enter through the gate again.</col>
