line	<str>Use the anvil in the northern tent. Following the plans, create a prototype dart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the dart to Al Shabim, who will in return give you the Tenti pineapple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your Slave outfit and head back to the guards in the mine with your pineapple and give it to one of them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the cave entrance and head east until you're beside the mine cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click search the nearby barrels to get a barrel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Get into the mine cart by right-click searching it. (If you fail to start the cutscene redo this step)</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the west-north-west path and use a barrel on Ana (blonde hair at the end of the second north-western path).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the mine cart. Put Ana in the mine cart, then take the cart yourself.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search nearby barrels to find Ana.</str>
line	
line	<str>Put Ana on the winch bucket (north-west area of room).</str>
line	
line	<str>Don't raise the guard's suspicions when he offers help.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head back to the surface.</col>
step	30	-	Quick guide step 30
line	<str>Begin the quest by talking to Irena, located just south of Shantay Pass (fairy ring BIQ, then run north-east).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Desert Mining Camp entrance (south of Irena).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Mercenary Captain.</str>
line	
line	<str>He will attack you. Kill him and get the key of the gate. (All damage can be dealt via recoil)</str>
line	
line	<str>Unequip any weapons AND armour and enter the gate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Male slave on the east wall (not the south-east wall) when a guard is not nearby. If you've already talked to him. If they spot you attempting to break the slave's cuffs you will be sent to the jail. To escape the jail you must bend the bars on the window, climb out, then climb over the rock wall and cliff. Then enter through the gate again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the slave's clothes</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the mine to the north</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path until you reach a guarded cave entrance.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to one of the guards until he mentions a Tenti pineapple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run back to the surface, unequip ALL pieces of your slave robes and leave the desert camp through the front gate, or return to fairy ring BIQ.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Al Shabim in the south tent in the Bedabin Camp (directly west of the Desert Mining Camp). You will be given a Bedabin key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Desert Mining Camp. (Make sure to put on your slave outfit (and unequip anything else) before entering the gate. If you inadvertently dropped your slave outfit, you can get another one from a slave by repeating the earlier trade with the desert clothing.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Go up the ladder in the jail building and search the southernmost bookcase on the western wall. A message should pop up stating "You notice several books on the subject of sailing."</str>
line	
line	<str>In the same room, talk to Captain Siad.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the chest to obtain the technical plans. (Make sure you click continue, so the plans go to your inventory)</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Bedabin Camp and show Al Shabim the plans.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the anvil in the northern tent. Following the plans, create a prototype dart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the dart to Al Shabim, who will in return give you the Tenti pineapple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your Slave outfit and head back to the guards in the mine with your pineapple and give it to one of them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the cave entrance and head east until you're beside the mine cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click search the nearby barrels to get a barrel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Get into the mine cart by right-click searching it. (If you fail to start the cutscene redo this step)</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the west-north-west path and use a barrel on Ana (blonde hair at the end of the second north-western path).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the mine cart. Put Ana in the mine cart, then take the cart yourself.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search nearby barrels to find Ana.</str>
line	
line	<str>Put Ana on the winch bucket (north-west area of room).</str>
line	
line	<str>Don't raise the guard's suspicions when he offers help.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the surface.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Operate the <col=800000>winch</col> (south-west in the camp), then search the barrel west of the winch to find Ana. (Do not go through the gate)</col>
